  (text "ManteTwin - Nodo de deriva (escenario 1): ESP32-DevKitC + 2 placas SHT30 por Grove" 
    (at 20.32 20.32 0) 
    (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) 
    (uuid "3dd5df92-6a18-4acc-921c-d9519ea556cc")) 
  (text "Equivale al proyecto Wokwi 01-deriba: mismos pines y mismo firmware (sketch.ino)." 
    (at 20.32 26.67 0) 
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) 
    (uuid "0da10bdd-0ec9-4588-bfca-ae0d189b9794")) 
  (text "Alimentacion: USB del DevKitC. +3V3 sale del regulador del DevKitC (J2-1)." 
    (at 20.32 162.56 0) 
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) 
    (uuid "6adcd40a-3bab-4c03-91c1-4751a7f4ff33")) 
  (text "J4 y J5: placas SHT30 ManteTwin. J4 con JP1 1-2 (0x44), J5 con JP1 2-3 (0x45)." 
    (at 142.24 40.64 0) 
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) 
    (uuid "1db211ce-2f3d-4d96-a3fc-53cf0d806bf9")) 
  (text "Pull-ups I2C: ya estan en cada placa SHT30 (4k7 + 4k7 en paralelo = 2k35, valido)." 
    (at 142.24 45.72 0) 
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) 
    (uuid "2925cea6-0a5d-4555-b792-fdc21e614505")) 
  (text "LEDs: verde = OK (GPIO25), rojo = deriva detectada (GPIO26), amarillo = fallo inyectado (GPIO27)" 
    (at 177.8 40.64 0) 
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) 
    (uuid "e4aca33c-d4b9-4b0f-b08f-fc78c41e6afe")) 
  (text "JP1 FALLO: con jumper, GPIO34 = HIGH -> label=1 en la telemetria (sustituye al pin FLT de Wokwi)." 
    (at 142.24 134.62 0) 
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) 
    (uuid "83dc5a75-ea2f-4774-9bc0-6341320c50d0")) 
  (text "GPIO34 es solo entrada y sin pull interno: R4 10k a GND obligatoria." 
    (at 142.24 139.7 0) 
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) 
    (uuid "0827bd72-2e6c-40de-8fc5-c0df5e02b4e9")) 
  (text "TP1-TP3: logic analyzer / osciloscopio en el bus I2C." 
    (at 208.28 104.14 0) 
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) 
    (uuid "46ea2a8c-031e-47b0-b2ed-b678ad1dcf43")) 
  (text "Verificar con la placa real la separacion entre J2 y J3 antes de hacer el PCB." 
    (at 20.32 167.64 0) 
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) 
    (uuid "eda42e0b-a889-42e0-b326-b5112d7b0108")) 
